This is a '''list of quotes by {{ai|Yoru}}'''. Yoru is voiced by Daisuke Takahashi in English. Necessary quotes are translated from Japanese to English. Yoru has a total of {{PAGESINCATEGORY:Yoru Quotes}} files of quotes including unused and removed lines, and excluding [[#The Range's lore assets|The Range's lore assets]].

A downloadable folder containing all the audio files on this page can be found [https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1BP8R9X4rqkmuG3DbF2HiTkYE5jqXSeZz?usp=sharing here].

