==Buy Phase==
===Match Start===
*{{AC|YoruMatchStart1.mp3}} "Should I shoot them in the face, or stab them in the back? I'll decide later."
*{{AC|YoruMatchStart2.mp3}} "So much fuss over nothing. Someone get me a bat, I'll finish this."
*{{AC|YoruMatchStart3.mp3}} "It's easiest if I sneak in and kill everyone. Don't make this complicated."
*{{AC|YoruMatchStart4.mp3}} "You're all obsessed with teamwork, so I'll try it. But just this once."
*{{AC|YoruMatchStart5.mp3}} "Five enemies. Five for me, none for anyone else."
*{{AC|YoruMatchStart6.mp3}} "A bunch of ざこ want to fight us. They must really want to die."
**(''ざこ/雑魚'': Minnows, in context meaning: insignificant people)
